\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 1.  Oh Jesus, listen to your child,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  Who does not know his needs,
\par  Out of your mercies and your love,
\par  Keep your children always.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. Hark! Your children coming to Thee,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 As their safe, hiding place.
\par Do embrace them and receive them;
\par \pard      Add me to their number.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

